+def test_qwen3_value_cannot_absorb_the_next_parameter_opener(sample_tools):
+    """The merge that published one call as another is ungrammatical.
+
+    A value that runs past its closer used to be more value text, so a dropped
+    ``</`` produced a different call that was still well formed, ordered and
+    schema-satisfying -- and was executed. With the opener excluded the model
+    cannot complete it: the only legal continuations are more value text or the
+    real closer.
